/Title (PROPOSED SOLUTION  A Java Swing desktop application with JDBC and MySQL lets the exam coordinator enter halls, exams and students and generate the seating plan automatically. Seats are allocated hall by hall without double-booking, keeping students of the same branch apart. Results are shown as a seating grid and can be searched and printed as reports.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1283 0 R
>>
